# README.md is an explicit requirement of the brief, not an optional extra.
/PLAN.md
/SKILLS.md
/GIT-WORKFLOW.md
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/PROGRESS.md
/notes/
/scratch/

# misc
.cache/
.temp/
*.local
